      "content": "Wait, anaphylaxis?? thats a bit dramatic isnt it. i deal with hay fever every spring and it always feels a bit weird in my throat sometimes. i'm pretty sure i just hit a bad patch of pollen. if i just take a little more of the allergy meds and maybe an ibuprofen for the dizziness, i'll be fine by morning right? i honestly just want to be sure i dont need to waste money on a doctor visit for what is probably just a bad allergy day.",
